error[E0277]: `std::cell::Cell<u8>` cannot be wrapped by #[refined]: it is not `tauten::refine::Frozen`
 --> tests/ui/refined_interior_mutability.rs:6:20
  |
6 | pub struct Percent(Cell<u8>);
  |                    ^^^^^^^^ the trait `Frozen` is not implemented for `std::cell::Cell<u8>`
  |
  = note: a refined value must not change after `try_new` checked it: interior mutability (`Cell`, `RefCell`, atomics, locks) or a user-written `Clone` could break the predicate
  = note: supported: primitives, `String`, and `Box`, `Option`, `Vec`, arrays, slices, tuples and `&'static` references of those
  = help: the following other types implement trait `Frozen`:
            &'static T
            ()
            (A, B)
            (A, B, C)
            (A, B, C, D)
            (A, B, C, D, E)
            (A, B, C, D, E, F)
            (A,)
          and $N others
note: required by a bound in `tauten::refine::Refined::Inner`
 --> src/refine.rs
  |
  |     type Inner: Frozen + ?Sized;
  |                 ^^^^^^ required by this bound in `Refined::Inner`
